                <pb facs="0186" n="80" sameAs="frus:frus1891/pg80"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Pacheco to Mr. Blaine</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States in Guatemala and
                                Honduras</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Guatemala</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1891-09-09"><hi rendition="#italic">September 9,
                        1891</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Pacheco states that the allusion of Salvadorian minister was evidently in
                    general terms that the Salvadorian Government would indemnify any vessel that
                    might be unjustly and exceptionally detained in Salvadorian ports.</p>
            </div>
